readme='''Ravedio262 - Wardrobe/accessory finishing

Pants: fixed legacy bare legs showing through both builds. Use explicit pants-only bases; other bottoms retain their original body base.
Triangle top: cleaned the stretched lower outer corner while preserving thickness, straps and bust/body geometry.
Hoodies: seated the lower rear hood fold; retained cavity/collar/cords/pocket/cuffs. Export now preserves separate sleeve trim and torso nodes.

Final eye catalogue: Original, Tapered oval, Soft hooded, Rounded bean. Existing geometry retained. Almond/Curved squint remain archived in261. No nose, regular smile only. Eight canonical color choices per role; Original(review) is a contextual source-color alias. No profile wire changes.

Use independent selectors, Compare261, Face/Chat portrait/Body, zoom and rotation. Fixed3D lighting. Chat framing uses the same face geometry and studio; exact32/48/64/120px sheets show readability on all four skin tones.

Package:6 independent component GLBs,2 assembled GLBs,2 packed final-GLB Blender assemblies,3 packed changed-top sources,24 matched color/depth pairs. All ordinary uncompressed GLBs. Read handoff262.json, technical262.json, assemblies262.json, depth262.json and findings262.json.

Validation:44 outfit pairings in8angles; hidden-arm contacts and bottom details;512 headgear/glasses/hair-detail images;240 exact small portraits;63 beard/headgear contacts;16 final assembly angles.135 local feature/assembly/color checks.1064 prior GLBs verified unchanged. Scripts under source record the local authoring pipeline; packed scenes are the portable reproducible references.

Next:optimize copies of the two assemblies, compare appearance, then qualify native3D/portrait rendering and transparency in seeded iOS/Android workloads. Source/export checks do not certify native rendering or phone performance. New corrections await owner review.
'''
